  'channel.wa.template.lede': 'WhatsApp lets you write freely within 24 hours of a customer\'s last message; after that, only with a message Meta approved. Nomi asks Meta to approve one that says a reply is waiting. Once it is approved, a reply you send after the 24 hours goes as that message, and your words wait in the reply box until the customer answers.',
